@Marc Davis :
Marc Davis  [6:13 PM]
New vibration theory. The vibration has not gotten any better than before after the tire balancing and spare swapping. @Jordan Jones and I were brainstorming about when it appeared. It seemed to be after the second Colvin trip. @Devin DuMont - did you turn self sense assist on in this car? If so, when? I'm beginning to wonder if this is like the Corvette Lowe rpm “growl” we experienced when we turned it on in that car. This would be the only W motor we have turned on SSA in and maybe that is the culprit. This car, at 60, is spinning at about the same speed that the Corvette is at 30 so there's a chance this is related. Can we confirm the EEPROM tomorrow and test?
